  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/P1450702.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(48 fotos) Hasta el 8 de enero se puede disfrutar la feria de atracciones de&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Onda Centre Comercial con mu&ntilde;eco gigante y nueve artificial, en la pista exterior pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo, junto a la tienda 5 Lobitos y Virgen del Carmen.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Est&aacute; abierta de 11 a 14 y de 17 a 21 horas.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadalondacentrecomercial16/p1450658.jpg\" alt=\"p1450658\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadalondacentrecomercial16/p1450659.jpg\" alt=\"p1450659\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadalondacentrecomercial16/p1450660.jpg\" alt=\"p1450660\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadalondacentrecomercial16/p1450661.jpg\" alt=\"p1450661\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadalondacentrecomercial16/p1450662.jpg\" alt=\"p1450662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firanadalondacentrecomercial16/p1450663.jpg\" alt=\"p1450663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25d